[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.580]   Good morning and welcome to the first quarter 2020 General Electric Company earnings conference
[00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:12.160]   call. My name is Brandon and I'll be your operator for today. At this time, I'll just
[00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.320]   be trying to listen on the mode. Later, we will conduct the question and answer session
