[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.560]   Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for standing by and welcome to the Ingersoll Rand 1st Quarter 2020 Earnings Conference Call.
[00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.080]   At this time, all participants are in a listen only mode.
[00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:15.940]   After the speaker's presentation, there will be a question and answer session.
