[00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:35.640]   I would now like to hand the conference over to your speaker today, Vic Kinney, Head of Investor Relations.
[00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.940]   Thank you. Please go ahead.
[00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:42.880]   Thank you and welcome to the Ingersoll Rand 2020 1st Quarter Earnings Call.
[00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.200]   I'm Vic Kinney, Ingersoll Rand Investor Relations Leader.
[00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:51.340]   And with me today are Vicente Renal, Chief Executive Officer, and Emily Weaver, Chief Financial Officer.
